00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:11.130
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:14.400
Since you guys have been asking for a nice
long Game of Thrones Martell video I thought

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.110
I’d talk about what’s happening with them
on the show in season 4 as well as in the

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:19.110
books.

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:22.450
I’m also developing a new Game Of Thrones
companion show that will debut when the show

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:23.450
comes back.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.980
They’re will be all kinds of fun stuff and
weekly giveaways.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:28.410
I’ll be posting a separate video later explaining
how it’s going to work.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.750
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:34.930
So In case you’re not caught up with the
books and you don’t want spoilers I’ll

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:39.680
let you know when to turn the volume down.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:43.329
Here we go House Martell during Season 4 starting
off with number 1 the cast.

00:00:43.329 --> 00:00:46.820
There will be two members representing House
Martell and Dorne during Season 4 including

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:52.480
Pedro Pascal as Oberyn Martell the Red Viper.
and Indira Varma as Ellaria Sand, one of his

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:55.730
lovers and mother of four of the 8 sand snakes.

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:58.379
The Red Viper’s bastard daughters.

00:00:58.379 --> 00:01:02.430
Because the show condenses so much of the
book story for time both characters will only

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:06.030
be in a few episodes despite being fairly
significant to the plot of Book 3.

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:08.610
2, let’s talk about their episodes.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:12.170
Pretty much all of Oberyn’s scenes will
be in King’s Landing with Tyrion and the

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:14.119
other members of the small council.

00:01:14.119 --> 00:01:15.189
Most notably Tywin.

00:01:15.189 --> 00:01:19.549
There’s even been some behind the scenes
set photos of Pedro Pascal in costume.

00:01:19.549 --> 00:01:23.460
Interestingly enough, there were also a lot
of pictures of him hanging out with Lena Headey

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:24.460
in real life.

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:27.000
In case anyone wants to start a Red Viper
Cersei ship.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.549
Ellaria is like Oberyn’s Shae, except she’s
not a hooker.

00:01:30.549 --> 00:01:34.040
She’ll appear in a few of Oberyn’s scenes,
but she won’t be a large part of Oberyn’s

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:35.040
secret mission.

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:39.360
You can expect some potential scenes with
Sansa, Cersei and Shae though.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.640
3 the backstory

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:44.430
There’s a really deep history between the
Lannisters and the Martell’s that goes all

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:46.390
the way back to Robert’s Rebellion.

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:48.890
Oberyn’s sister Elia was Prince Rhaegar’s
wife.

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:52.259
She was killed by The Mountain and the whole
thing was covered up by Tywin Lannister so

00:01:52.259 --> 00:01:55.350
that it wouldn’t start another war with
Dorne.

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:58.860
Because Tyrion granted the Martell’s a seat
on the Small Council in exchange for help

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:03.180
during the battle of blackwater in season
2, Oberyn’s brother Doran uses that as an

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:06.079
opportunity for them to learn the truth of
Elia’s death.

00:02:06.079 --> 00:02:09.530
As a result of Sherlocking his way around
King’s Landing, Oberyn gets caught up in

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:12.090
the events of the purple wedding and tyrion’s
fate.

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.840
So look forward to some good Pedro Pascal
Peter Dinklage scenes.

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:15.840
The funny thing is that by the time Oberyn
makes it to King’s Landing, Tyrion has already

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:16.840
fallen from grace.

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:18.750
House Martell and Dorne really become more
of a destination for the story in a feast

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:21.109
for crows, dance with dragons and winds of
winter.

00:02:21.109 --> 00:02:25.280
Number 4, Here’s where we need to talk about
what’s going on with them in Winds of Winter.

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.190
This will be about things in the books, not
the show.

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:30.949
So if you don’t want potential spoilers
turn the volume down now.

00:02:30.949 --> 00:02:33.100
4, the sand snakes.

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:37.769
House Martell and the sand snakes become much
more physically present in Kings Landing during

00:02:37.769 --> 00:02:38.769
winds of winter.

00:02:38.769 --> 00:02:42.480
They’re all part of a larger espionage mission
to learn more about the Lannister’s plot

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:45.440
to get rid of Prince Doran.

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:50.310
Nymeria takes Oberyn’s seat on the small
council, Tyene poses as a septa to try and

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:51.739
get information from the High Sparrow.

00:02:51.739 --> 00:02:55.780
That’s the same High Sparrow that makes
Cersei march naked through the streets.

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:58.644
Sarella poses as a maester in training in
Oldtown to try and get more information about

00:02:58.644 --> 00:03:00.560
the lannister plot and Obara hunts for the
Darkstar.

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:04.690
Remember he maimed Mrycella after their plot
to crown her queen of westeros failed.

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:09.030
The really cool thing I always liked about
them were that they felt so much more organized

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:12.820
and effective than the brave companions or
the brotherhood without banners.

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:17.080
I guess you could say that the faceless ones
in the east are more fearsome, but the Sand

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:19.949
Snakes are my favorite westerosi supergroup.

00:03:19.949 --> 00:03:21.290
Number 5, the east.

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:26.590
The Martells storyline in the east is almost
non-existent after what happens to quentyn,

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:29.560
so most of their storyline will follow the
sand snakes in Kings Landing

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:31.380
Number 6, the mummers dragon.

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:34.970
Because House Martell has been neutral during
the war of the five kings, whoever wants to

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:37.590
take the iron throne from the lannisters will
need their help.

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:41.790
Because Aegon is alive, they also send Arianne
to find out if he is really Aegon.

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:44.880
Because that would make him Prince Doran’s
nephew.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:48.650
I haven’t seen any evidence to contradict
that he really is Aegon, so I think that during

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:56.750
Winds of Winter he and Jon Connington will
join forces with dorne against the lannisters.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.190
Number 7, dance of the dragons round 2.

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:03.190
Aegon’s plan to claim the throne is also
in direct conflict with daenerys.

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:07.350
Remember the short story the dance of the
dragons that george rr martin just published.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:09.820
I think that will also end up happening again.

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:11.700
But maybe not until dream of spring.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:18.859
The real story to pay attention to is Aegon
and the Martell’s plan to take control of

00:04:18.859 --> 00:04:20.000
westeros, let me know how you think it will
go down.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.000
Personally I think it will leave them weaker
than ever.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.620
Remember how the original dance of the dragons
ended.

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:25.570
Nobody really ends up winning in a war.

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:28.410
One side just ends up losing a little bit
less than the other side.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.070
Spoilers over, you can turn the volume back
up.

